```

Explain why the following two code fragments are NOT logically equivalent for all values of `x`:
```python
# Fragment A
if x > 0:
    if x < 10:
        print("Small positive")
    else:
        print("Large positive")
else:
    print("Non-positive")

# Fragment B
if x > 0 and x < 10:
    print("Small positive")
elif x > 0:
    print("Large positive")
else:
    print("Non-positive")
```

